    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lābros</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-us</span></b> , = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάβρος</span> (greedy).
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A fish</i>, otherwise unknown, <i><span class="en">Plin. 32,
				11, 54, § 152</span></i> (Jahn,
			melanarum).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lā-bros</span></b> , <i>the name of a dog</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3,
				224</span></i>.</div>
